abstract: "Lean theorem-facing verification synchronized to the internal v87 major-revision manuscript Distributional Learning of Context-Free Languages under Fixed Finite-Monoid Typing. The artifact includes the completed level-coded Appendix substitutability proof, exact finite indexed R_n/R_n^- grammar packages, ordinary-thickness and fixed-window bounds, the exponential characteristic-sample lower bound, and exact-version v87 synchronization with green CI."
